OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 17 MAY
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French explores Heinrich
OL,6,     GSchutz's 26 psalm settings, which
OL,7,     Gwere one of the first major
OL,8,     Gcollections of choral music in
OL,9,     Gthe German language.
OL,10,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,11,     GLive from Bristol Cathedral on
OL,12,     Gthe Eve of the Ascension, with
OL,13,     Gmusic by Stanford, Jonathan Dove,
OL,14,     GFinzi and Laurin.
OL,15,G1900FSunday Feature: South African
OL,16,     FArias
OL,17,     GLindsay Johns explores the
OL,18,     Gflourishing of operatic talent in
OL,19,     Gpost-Apartheid South Africa.
